  "notes": "Label = purple 'Port' name (MCU port pin, treated as the GPIO name under rule 5); white 'Name' box (board silkscreen) first in functions, then the green Arduino name and remaining tags read outward. 'OCA4' (sic) and 'OC4B' carry an overline in the image (inverted output) which is omitted. 'TO' and 'TXO' printed with a letter O. SS/PB0/D17 RX_LED and TX_LED/D30/PD5 entries are LED signals without a pin position and were skipped; J1 solder jumper skipped."
